{"id":"d7c09bb4839684b7ba7dd30297a442be42c03fd4","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240599","title":"今晚 iOS27rc 就出来了 国行 AI 会上线吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"snsn","excerpt":"Apple - @snsn - 感觉都麻了","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>感觉都麻了</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/iOS\"><li></li> iOS</a><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/国行\"><li></li> 国行</a></P><p><span>21 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-10 02:45:52 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065147\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b3d0/4cbe/427384_normal.png?m=1755166367\" alt=\"94\" data-uid=\"427384\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/94\">94</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 10:49:40 +08:00\">21h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>Apple 的那个 AI 有啥用啊... 虽然说有总比没有好，但是已经完全提不起来兴趣了。还要占用 7G 的存储空间。</p><p>更应该关注的应该是折叠屏的应用适配吧。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065456\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/974c/f0b1/157221_normal.png?m=1711449099\" alt=\"kera0a\" data-uid=\"157221\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kera0a\">kera0a</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 11:29:16 +08:00\">20h 27m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/94\">94</a> <br>折叠屏的适配就是 iPadOS ，不用单独适配了。<br>适配了 iPadOS 的应用本身就会响应窗口尺寸变化来改变布局。</p><p>至于没适配的 app 在折叠屏估计都是兼容模式运行</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065478\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 11:31:08 +08:00\">20h 26m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>毫无兴趣</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065567\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9fb/75a9/592575_normal.png?m=1670228766\" alt=\"kaleido\" data-uid=\"592575\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kaleido\">kaleido</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 11:40:40 +08:00\">20h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我更看好 Apple 和阿里合作训练的那个 Apple Foundation Model ，iOS27 的那款 Siri ，iOS26 的还是算了，跑马灯那个依旧智障</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065681\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e2b1/4142/483358_normal.png?m=1739935514\" alt=\"seedhk\" data-uid=\"483358\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/seedhk\">seedhk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 11:54:24 +08:00\">20h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国服版本和千问合作？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065739\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4f2dbd216169dccc5003303eaf0b02e1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Aaron36\" data-uid=\"206967\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Aaron36\">Aaron36</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 12:03:16 +08:00\">19h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/kaleido\">kaleido</a> Apple Foundation Model  这个是和阿里合作的？  这个不是苹果的一个框架吗？然后这个框架可以接入其他符合要的的模型吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18065765\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f5dc/0915/43239_normal.png?m=1772119990\" alt=\"wclebb\" data-uid=\"43239\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wclebb\">wclebb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 12:11:15 +08:00\">19h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>先看看发布会怎么说吧，再怎么说今年也该出来了。<br>模型都批了，剩下就是什么时候发布的问题。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066086\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc4a/fbcc/274199_normal.png?m=1683209705\" alt=\"Building\" data-uid=\"274199\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Building\">Building</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 13:33:54 +08:00\">18h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>和微软一样真 • 用心做动画，每个 beta 主要就是更新动画，那个 Siri app 我怀疑他们真的没有人用吗？都卡成 ppt 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066248\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a134/7f9e/713561_normal.png?m=1788312220\" alt=\"tctocn\" data-uid=\"713561\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tctocn\">tctocn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 13:58:43 +08:00\">17h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 可以不要，NFC 赶紧开放吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066496\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b32b23ab565b83c318711e5efdb92b6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"B3TL\" data-uid=\"660405\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/B3TL\">B3TL</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 14:33:41 +08:00\">17h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/94\">94</a> 目前来看最大的更新是动画更炫了哈哈哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066810\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c967/4a23/240626_normal.png?m=1787829967\" alt=\"eriko\" data-uid=\"240626\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/eriko\">eriko</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 15:18:15 +08:00\">16h 38m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>真希望快点来啊🥲想用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066843\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a131/a5f6/346625_normal.png?m=1782531632\" alt=\"ajyz\" data-uid=\"346625\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ajyz\">ajyz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 15:23:41 +08:00\">16h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>估计没有，测试版影子都没有，要知道本地的可以藏着，云端的那部分有的话藏不住，而 Siri Ai 英文以外的首发不会有，那国内即便有也是跑马灯 Siri ，独一份的国内云端接入，没有任何测试？感觉不太可能。所以个人更倾向于明年初随其它语言一起推出。<br>ps：跑马灯 Siri 即便有也只能是聊胜于无</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18066872\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a131/a5f6/346625_normal.png?m=1782531632\" alt=\"ajyz\" data-uid=\"346625\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ajyz\">ajyz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 15:26:26 +08:00\">16h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/94\">94</a> 不止，看了下我手机上 Apple 智能占用空间是 17.5G （港版，开启过 Siri Ai ，现在退回了跑马灯 Siri ）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067327\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://c